  "api": {
    "ids": {
      "FaithMagicDamage": 8,
      "FaithMagicHealing": 12
    },
    "context": "Physical inputs or AbilityFormulaMagicContext with MA, attacker/target FaithValue, undead/modifier/element facts. Wrong-family input rejects before formula draws.",
    "results": "Existing physical result plus raw signed Healing and opaque magic projection; internal HP routing is reused by the existing composer.",
    "normalConsumers": "FaithMagicFormula.Resolve and ResolveAfterHit now select AbilityFormula IDs from their existing kind/power binding.",
    "modeMapping": "Explicit Magic Execute/AiSimulation/Preview to Ability Execution/Ai/Preview; never cast ordinal values."
  },
  "boundaries": [
    "Reuses unchanged FaithMagicAmountFormula, FaithMagicArithmetic and FaithMagicHpRouting; no new arithmetic implementation.",
    "Preserves source modifier ordering, signed stores, Faith/Innocent precedence, elemental nullification/absorption and undead reversal.",
    "Standalone dispatch handles amount/HP routing only and consumes no magic RNG. Existing resolver retains evasion/proc/status composition, finalization, rollback and authority gates.",
    "Physical delivery definitions explicitly reject magic IDs. Prepared schemas and existing live spell kind/power bindings remain unchanged.",
    "Other formula IDs, generic accuracy/status/MP/stat results, inventory/menu dispatch and arbitrary prepared magic formula reassignment remain unsupported."
  ],
